从快捷搜索到本地模型的一体化效率中枢","url":"https://bbs.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/100377530#:~:text=%E4%BA%8E%202026","text":"于 2026-09-24 03:24:30 修改","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":13,"cited_message_id":"75a52580-d074-41a7-84c6-83db968ecacc","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":6,"end_line_num":15,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":6667,"end_ix":6679,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Windows AI 启动器实战：从快捷搜索到本地模型的一体化效率中枢","url":"https://bbs.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/100377530#:~:text=%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8CFlow%20Launcher%20%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20,%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%B8%A6%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E6%8B%BC%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AE%A9%20AI","text":"实现方式上，Flow Launcher 有一个 `Flow.Launcher.Plugin.Script` 之类的脚本插件，也可以自己写 Python 或 C# 插件。以 Python 插件为例，它会往启动器里注册一个新的动作前缀，当你在输入框里输入 `sum C:\\users\\xxx\\1.txt` 时，插件读取该文件内容，调用配置好的 AI 接口，把结果返回。关键是要做好\"参数解析\"和\"异常处理\"：文件路径可能带空格，要正确拼接；文件可能不存在，要给出明确报错，而不是让 AI","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"1e77bb0d-00a3-47cf-9ae3-8bea47fceb37","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":25,"end_line_num":33,"connector_source":""},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":6807,"end_ix":6819,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Windows AI 启动器实战：从快捷搜索到本地模型的一体化效率中枢","url":"https://bbs.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/100377530#:~:text=match%20at%20L155%20%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8CFlow%20Launcher,%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%B8%A6%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E6%8B%BC%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AE%A9%20AI","text":"match at L155 实现方式上，Flow Launcher 有一个 `Flow.Launcher.Plugin.Script` 之类的脚本插件，也可以自己写 Python 或 C# 插件。以 Python 插件为例，它会往启动器里注册一个新的动作前缀，当你在输入框里输入 `sum C:\\users\\xxx\\1.txt` 时，插件读取该文件内容，调用配置好的 AI 接口，把结果返回。关键是要做好\"参数解析\"和\"异常处理\"：文件路径可能带空格，要正确拼接；文件可能不存在，要给出明确报错，而不是让 AI","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"1e77bb0d-00a3-47cf-9ae3-8bea47fceb37","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":23,"end_line_num":31,"connector_source":""},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":6859,"end_ix":6871,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Windows AI 启动器实战：从快捷搜索到本地模型的一体化效率中枢","url":"https://bbs.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/100377530#:~:text=%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8CFlow%20Launcher%20%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20,%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%B8%A6%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E6%8B%BC%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AE%A9%20AI","text":"实现方式上，Flow Launcher 有一个 `Flow.Launcher.Plugin.Script` 之类的脚本插件，也可以自己写 Python 或 C# 插件。以 Python 插件为例，它会往启动器里注册一个新的动作前缀，当你在输入框里输入 `sum C:\\users\\xxx\\1.txt` 时，插件读取该文件内容，调用配置好的 AI 接口，把结果返回。关键是要做好\"参数解析\"和\"异常处理\"：文件路径可能带空格，要正确拼接；文件可能不存在，要给出明确报错，而不是让 AI","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"1e77bb0d-00a3-47cf-9ae3-8bea47fceb37","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":25,"end_line_num":33,"connector_source":""},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":6933,"end_ix":6945,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Connecting AI Agents to RemNote with MCP | RemNote Help Center","url":"https://help.remnote.com/en/articles/16424066-connecting-ai-agents-to-remnote-with-mcp#:~:text=The%20RemNote%20desktop%20app%20includes,it%20takes%20about%20a%20minute","text":"The RemNote desktop app includes a built-in MCP server that runs on your computer. Connecting it takes about a minute.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":24,"cited_message_id":"3f023cab-40ee-48d5-8684-2dd7dcd3fec3","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":26,"end_line_num":35,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":6979,"end_ix":6991,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Connecting AI Agents to RemNote with MCP | RemNote Help Center","url":"https://help.remnote.com/en/articles/16424066-connecting-ai-agents-to-remnote-with-mcp#:~:text=The%20RemNote%20desktop%20app%20includes,it%20takes%20about%20a%20minute","text":"The RemNote desktop app includes a built-in MCP server that runs on your computer. Connecting it takes about a minute.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":24,"cited_message_id":"3f023cab-40ee-48d5-8684-2dd7dcd3fec3","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":26,"end_line_num":35,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":8088,"end_ix":8100,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"What is the Model Context Protocol (MCP)? - Model Context Protocol","url":"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/2026-07-28/getting-started/intro#:~:text=MCP%20,AI%20applications%20to%20external%20systems","text":"MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open-source standard for connecting AI applications to external systems. Using MCP, AI applications like Claude or ChatGPT can connect to data sources (e.g. local files, databases), tools (e.g. search engines, calculators) and workflows (e.g. specialized prompts)—enabling them to access key information and perform tasks. Think of MCP like a USB-C port for AI applications. Just as USB-C provides a standardized way to connect electronic devices, MCP provides a standardized way to connect AI applications to external systems.","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":29,"cited_message_id":"10a7da72-f13b-401d-acb6-b6eee19906c4","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":29,"end_line_num":37,"connector_source":null},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":8481,"end_ix":8493,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"Windows AI 启动器实战：从快捷搜索到本地模型的一体化效率中枢","url":"https://bbs.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/100377530#:~:text=%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8A%EF%BC%8CFlow%20Launcher%20%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%20,%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%B8%A6%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E6%8B%BC%E6%8E%A5%EF%BC%9B%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E8%A6%81%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E6%98%8E%E7%A1%AE%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%AE%A9%20AI","text":"实现方式上，Flow Launcher 有一个 `Flow.Launcher.Plugin.Script` 之类的脚本插件，也可以自己写 Python 或 C# 插件。以 Python 插件为例，它会往启动器里注册一个新的动作前缀，当你在输入框里输入 `sum C:\\users\\xxx\\1.txt` 时，插件读取该文件内容，调用配置好的 AI 接口，把结果返回。关键是要做好\"参数解析\"和\"异常处理\"：文件路径可能带空格，要正确拼接；文件可能不存在，要给出明确报错，而不是让 AI","pub_date":null,"extra":{"cited_message_idx":15,"cited_message_id":"1e77bb0d-00a3-47cf-9ae3-8bea47fceb37","search_result_idx":null,"evidence_text":"","start_line_num":25,"end_line_num":33,"connector_source":""},"og_tags":null}},{"start_ix":8947,"end_ix":8958,"citation_format_type":"tether_v4","metadata":{"type":"webpage","title":"How Command Palette extensions work | Microsoft Learn","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/powertoys/command-palette/extensibility-overview#:~:text=Command%20Palette%20extensions%20are%20standalone,secure%2C%20and%20easy%20to%20deploy","text":"Command Palette extensions are standalone .NET applications that communicate with Command Palette through a WinRT API. Each extension runs in its own pr